# Force LF everywhere. Scripts and compose files run in Linux (WSL),
# and CRLF line endings from Windows editors break shell scripts.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
